package: Marker Notes
author: Luciann V.
version: 1.4
rv: 4.0.0
requires: ""

modes:
  - file: rvMarkerNotes.py
    load: immediate

description: |
  <p>Package to create a pop up when adding a marker to timeline, but instead of pressing m-key, press j-key. 
  If user needs to edit a note on marker, can press j again to to edit, and new note will override old one.
  After saving session, marker notes along timeline persist.</p>
